---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---
<Layout active="fisheries" title="Fisheries — NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM" description="Fisheries, maritime commerce and supplies connected to Mauritania.">
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid two" style="align-items:center"><div><div class="kicker" data-en="Fisheries & maritime commerce" data-es="Pesca y comercio marítimo" data-fr="Pêche et commerce maritime">Fisheries & maritime commerce</div><h1 class="h1" data-en="Commercial opportunities around Mauritania’s maritime economy." data-es="Oportunidades comerciales alrededor de la economía marítima de Mauritania." data-fr="Opportunités commerciales autour de l’économie maritime mauritanienne.">Commercial opportunities around Mauritania’s maritime economy.</h1><p class="lead" data-en="Mauritania has a strong maritime identity. Our role is to connect serious buyers, suppliers and operators through practical, well-defined conversations." data-es="Mauritania tiene una fuerte identidad marítima. Nuestro papel es conectar compradores, proveedores y operadores serios mediante conversaciones prácticas y bien definidas." data-fr="La Mauritanie possède une forte identité maritime. Notre rôle est de connecter acheteurs, fournisseurs et opérateurs sérieux par des échanges pratiques et bien définis.">Mauritania has a strong maritime identity. Our role is to connect serious buyers, suppliers and operators through practical, well-defined conversations.</p></div><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><Icon name="ship" /><h3 data-en="Fish products" data-es="Productos pesqueros" data-fr="Produits de pêche">Fish products</h3></div><div class="card"><Icon name="oil" /><h3 data-en="Marine lubricants" data-es="Lubricantes marítimos" data-fr="Lubrifiants marins">Marine lubricants</h3></div><div class="card"><Icon name="factory" /><h3 data-en="Sector supplies" data-es="Suministros" data-fr="Fournitures">Sector supplies</h3></div><div class="card"><Icon name="handshake" /><h3 data-en="Operators" data-es="Operadores" data-fr="Opérateurs">Operators</h3></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><SectionHeader kicker="Focus areas" kickerEs="Áreas clave" kickerFr="Axes clés" title="From fish commercialisation to supplies for maritime operators." titleEs="Desde comercialización de pescado hasta suministros para operadores marítimos." titleFr="De la commercialisation du poisson aux fournitures pour opérateurs maritimes." /></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid three"><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="ship" /></div><h3 data-en="Fish and seafood" data-es="Pescado y marisco" data-fr="Poisson et fruits de mer">Fish and seafood</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Initial conversations with buyers interested in Mauritanian maritime products and distribution opportunities." data-es="Conversaciones iniciales con compradores interesados en productos marítimos mauritanos y oportunidades de distribución." data-fr="Échanges initiaux avec acheteurs intéressés par les produits maritimes mauritaniens et la distribution.">Initial conversations with buyers interested in Mauritanian maritime products and distribution opportunities.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="oil" /></div><h3 data-en="Outboard motor needs" data-es="Necesidades de fuera borda" data-fr="Besoins hors-bord">Outboard motor needs</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Lubricants and consumables for boats, fishing operators, workshops and professional users." data-es="Lubricantes y consumibles para barcos, operadores pesqueros, talleres y usuarios profesionales." data-fr="Lubrifiants et consommables pour bateaux, opérateurs de pêche, ateliers et utilisateurs professionnels.">Lubricants and consumables for boats, fishing operators, workshops and professional users.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="document" /></div><h3 data-en="Traceability and clarity" data-es="Trazabilidad y claridad" data-fr="Traçabilité et clarté">Traceability and clarity</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We prioritise clear information, documentation and realistic steps before advancing any trade conversation." data-es="Priorizamos información clara, documentación y pasos realistas antes de avanzar cualquier conversación comercial." data-fr="Nous privilégions informations claires, documentation et étapes réalistes avant toute discussion commerciale.">We prioritise clear information, documentation and realistic steps before advancing any trade conversation.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:36px"><div class="grid two" style="align-items:center"><div><h2 class="h2" data-en="Why fisheries connect naturally with DeluxeLube." data-es="Por qué la pesca conecta naturalmente con DeluxeLube." data-fr="Pourquoi la pêche est naturellement liée à DeluxeLube.">Why fisheries connect naturally with DeluxeLube.</h2><p class="lead" data-en="Small boats and outboard motors are part of daily maritime activity. Deluxe 2T Virgin Oil gives us a concrete product line for the fishing and marine ecosystem in Mauritania." data-es="Las pequeñas embarcaciones y motores fuera borda forman parte de la actividad marítima diaria. Deluxe 2T Virgin Oil nos da una línea concreta para el ecosistema pesquero y marítimo en Mauritania." data-fr="Les petites embarcations et moteurs hors-bord font partie de l’activité maritime quotidienne. Deluxe 2T Virgin Oil nous donne une ligne concrète pour l’écosystème pêche et maritime en Mauritanie.">Small boats and outboard motors are part of daily maritime activity. Deluxe 2T Virgin Oil gives us a concrete product line for the fishing and marine ecosystem in Mauritania.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/deluxelube/"><Icon name="oil" />DeluxeLube</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
